    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to choose a point within Close range and make an attack roll against all enemies within Close range of that point. Targets the attack succeeds against take <strong>4d12</strong> direct physical damage and are <em>Vulnerable</em> until they are spotlighted. Additionally, the entire area becomes rubble, and a PC must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll (16) to move through it.</p>",
